---
title: "Generation Role Mapping (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_validate_gen: receive generation, discord_role_id
    q_validate_gen --> q_check_gen: generation is number
    q_check_gen --> q_validate_role: generation > 0
    q_check_gen --> q_error_gen: generation <= 0
    q_validate_role --> q_check_role: discord_role_id is string
    q_check_role --> q_create_mapping: discord_role_id is valid Discord role
    q_check_role --> q_error_role: invalid Discord role
    q_create_mapping --> q_final: create GenerationRole(generation, discord_role_id)
    q_final --> [*]: return GenerationRole
    q_error_gen --> [*]: revert error
    q_error_role --> [*]: revert error

    note right of q_create_mapping
        INV-001: generation must be positive integer
        INV-002: discord_role_id must be valid Discord snowflake
        INV-003: each generation maps to exactly one discord_role_id
    end note
